    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Day 1 \r\n\r\nDear Diary,\r\n\r\nThe other day, our boat was wiped
        out by a huge storm, and ever since me and my crew have been washed up in
        this strange ocean plagued by otherworldly structures and equally as ethereal
        fish. Any sense of the world we know seems to have finished and, whilst my
        crew is optimistic of escape, I\u2019m really worried.\r\nJust the other
        day, there was this place with this huge eyeball watching us the whole time,
        surrounded by fish with eyeballs that felt equally as large and terrifying
        .They were attacking the boat, it really did feel like the end.\r\nRight
        now , escape feels impossible. But, having the crew I\u2019ve spent all these
        years with by my side makes it easier to push forward. I hope things improve
        soon.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
